function guide(){modal('Design, test, improve',`<button class="primary" id="guide-examples">Try a guided practice case ↗</button><p><a href="https://github.com/doubleteng/tengteng/tree/main/teaching/egress" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Application source</a> · <a href="./THIRD_PARTY.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Licenses + CAD decoder source</a></p><div class="help-step"><b>1</b><div><strong>Draw or import</strong><p>Draw walls with automatic snapping; hold Shift for orthogonal segments. Closed loops create rooms and their floor enclosure automatically. Add doors and exits on the walls. Import DWG, DXF or 2D Rhino linework; choose layers and confirm units. Calibrate PDFs and images, then use Trace image / PDF linework to review extracted linework and create walls.</p></div></div><div class="help-step"><b>2</b><div><strong>Connect the whole journey</strong><p>Use a shared XY origin and a reference-floor overlay. Stair links need matching names and overlapping footprints. Multi-height space cuts upper-floor slabs from its occupied base through the selected top floor. On the site, draw walkable areas, obstacles and real public-way connections. Mark assembly points separately.</p></div></div><div class="help-step"><b>3</b><div><strong>Play with the design</strong><p>Drag objects or their handles. Checks update after each edit. Use All floors to edit linked plans side by side; the ground floor and site share one view, Play to follow paths, and a baseline to compare changes.</p></div></div><div class="help-step"><b>4</b><div><strong>Explain the result</strong><p>Click a check to find the issue. Trace common paths and dead ends, confirm the net/gross area basis, and save a PDF report on your device with the assumptions and unresolved checks. Edit the recognized rooms, walls and doors directly in the lab; area, occupant loads and route checks update after each change.</p></div></div><div class="callout">Enter: finish shape · Escape: cancel · Delete: remove selection · Ctrl/Cmd+Z: undo · Ctrl/Cmd+S: save file · Right-button drag: pan · wheel: zoom at cursor · Shift / F8: Ortho · F9: Grid · Alt: bypass snap for other drawing tools<br>Visibility controls affect display only. Hidden analysis walls and obstacles still count.</div>${target().image?'<button id="calibrate-start">Calibrate image using two points</button>':''}`);$('#guide-examples').onclick=()=>{$('#modal').close();showExamples();};if($('#calibrate-start'))$('#calibrate-start').onclick=()=>{$('#modal').close();setTool('calibrate');$('#hint').textContent='Click the two ends of a known distance on the image.';};}
